data: {"type":"response.output_item.done","output_index":34,"item":{"id":"st_tmp_s9v55xyhfsr","type":"openrouter:web_fetch","status":"completed","url":"https://podcast.aftersugarclub.com/episode-198/","content":"\"I don't numb the pain away with sugar anymore\": Sarah (Episode 198) - Life After Sugar Podcast\n\n# Listen to episode 198:\n\n# \"I don't numb the pain away with sugar anymore\": Sarah\n\nOctober 27, 2024\n\nSarah grew up with a mother who was very intentional with feeding her family healthy food. She cooked everything from scratch.\n\nAs a child, Sarah didn't have any exposure to sugar whatsoever.\n\nAnd because there was no option for sugar in her life, Sarah says that she was neutral around food.\n\nUntil her late thirties, when she decided to do a popular elimination diet. She had no weight to lose at the time, but she wanted to see what the hype was about.\n\nSo she went on a 30-day elimination diet where she cut out categories of foods, like legumes and dairy and grains and certain fruits, certain starchy vegetables... and of course, sugar. Later, she also cut alcohol.\n\nBut that 30-day elimination diet put Sarah in a calorie restricted state. And for the first time in her life, she felt totally out of control around food.\n\nListen to how cutting sugar and alcohol forced Sarah to learn to deal with her emotional pain and physical pain in healthier ways. And how she developed healthier coping skills than sugar or food.\n\nGet rid of cravings so that you can slim down and finally feel in control around food!\n\nTake the first step to get rid of cravings:\n\nDo the Cravings Quiz!\n\nTo get personalized guidance from me, plus support and accountability in a small group... apply here to join the 90-day Freedom from Cravings Formula program TODAY.\n\nSEE ALSO:\n\nClick here to listen\n\nClick here to listen\n\nClick here to listen\n\nClick here to listen\n\nClick here to listen\n\nClick here to listen\n\nUse the Search bar below to find an episode number, topic or guest:\n\nSearch\n\nListen on any of these podcast platforms and subscribe:\n\nListen on Apple Podcasts\n\nListen on Google Podcasts\n\nAlso check out the Life After Sugar Facebook page, and subscribe to my Instagram account, TikTok, and to the Life After Sugar YouTube channel.\n\nTo rate and review this podcast:\n\n1. scroll down in your podcast player on your phone and click on the stars.\n2. To leave a review, scroll down a little more and click on \"Write a Review\".\n3. Once you’ve finished, select “Send” or “Save” in the top-right corner.\n4. If you’ve never left a podcast review before, enter a nickname. Your nickname will be displayed on your review.\n5. After selecting a nickname, tap OK. Your review may not be immediately visible, but it should be posted soon. Thank you! - Netta\n\nGET RID OF YOUR CRAVINGS\n\n## and find peace with food\n\n##### Grab these 5 tips now to help get rid of your cravings!\n\nYES! I WANT TO GET RID OF CRAVINGS!\n\n#### ALL EPISODES >>\n\n## Page Links\n\n- https://podcast.aftersugarclub.com/\n- https://aftersugarclub.com/cravings-quiz-entry/\n- https://www.sarahgraced.com/\n- https://aftersugarclub.com/freedom-from-cravings-formula-program/\n- https://podcast.aftersugarclub.com/episode-154/\n- https://podcast.aftersugarclub.com/episode-167/\n- https://podcast.aftersugarclub.com/episode-074/\n- https://podcast.aftersugarclub.com/episode-071/\n- https://podcast.aftersugarclub.com/episode-062/\n- https://podcast.aftersugarclub.com/episode-052/\n- https://podcasts.apple.com/podcast/id1546092478\n- https://open.spotify.com/show/4J0JySp6hdi9g2rhaKSR03\n- https://podcasts.google.com/feed/aHR0cHM6Ly9mZWVkcy5idXp6c3Byb3V0LmNvbS8xNDk5NzUyLnJzcw==\n- https://www.iheart.com/podcast/269-life-after-sugar-74970422/\n- https://www.facebook.com/mylifeaftersugar\n- https://www.instagram.com/mylifeaftersugar/\n- https://www.tiktok.com/@netta_lifeaftersugar\n- https://www.youtube.com/c/LifeAfterSugar/videos\n- https://aftersugarclub.com/5-tips-cravings/\n- https://aftersugarclub.com/\n- https://aftersugarclub.com/success-stories/\n- https://aftersugarclub.com/contact/\n- https://aftersugarclub.com/privacy-policy/\n- https://aftersugarclub.com/terms/\n","title":"\"I don't numb the pain away with sugar anymore\": Sarah (Episode 198) - Life After Sugar Podcast","httpStatus":200},"sequence_number":989}

data: {"type":"response.output_item.done","output_index":35,"item":{"id":"st_tmp_f2bqqx561ur","type":"openrouter:web_fetch","status":"completed","url":"https://www.buzzsprout.com/2543027/episodes/18352487-my-story-breaking-free-from-sugar-addiction","content":"My Story: Breaking Free from Sugar Addiction\n\nplayers--transcripts#highlightSegment\">\n\n# Living Life Unbinged with Kristy\n\nLiving Life Unbinged is a faith-based podcast for Christian women struggling with sugar addiction, binge eating, and food obsession. This show helps women break free from the binge-shame-reset cycle through biblical truth, recovery tools, and Spirit-led boundaries. If you’re tired of relying on willpower, stuck in moderation, or craving a more peaceful, God-led way to heal your relationship with food, you’re in the right place.\n\nNEXT STEPS\n\n🔥 Join the 7-Day Breaking Free From Food Addiction Challenge: https://lifeunbinged.com/qs-weight-loss-bundle/\n\n📘 Download the FREE Guide – Breaking Free From Food Addiction: https://lifeunbinged.com/breaking-free-from-food-addiction\n\nShow More\n\n## Living Life Unbinged with Kristy\n\n# My Story: Breaking Free from Sugar Addiction\n\nDecember 16, 2025 • Kristy McCammon • Season 1 • Episode 1\n\ndiv]:ring-green-500 [&>div]:bg-green-50\" data-timestamp-base-url=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/2543027/episodes/18352487\"> Share\n\ndialog#clickAway\">\n\n## Share episode\n\nCopy\n\nStart at\n\nplayer#rewind:passive keydown.shift+right@document->player#forward:passive player:chapter-time@document->player#startAtTimeStamp\" data-player-duration-value=\"483\">\n\nplayer#handleScrub keyup.space->player#toggle\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n\n0:00 | 8:03\n\nShow Notes Chapters\n\nFor years, I was trapped in sugar addiction, food obsession, and the constant cycle of shame, starting over, and feeling stuck. Food ruled my thoughts. Cravings controlled my choices. And freedom felt impossible.\n\nBut Jesus changed everything.\n\nIn this very first episode of Living Life Unbinged, I’m sharing my personal story — how God met me in my brokenness, helped me break free from sugar addiction, quieted the food noise in my mind, and led me to lose over 100 pounds through surrender, faith, and simple daily obedience.\n\nIf you’ve ever:\n\n- Felt controlled by cravings\n- Felt ashamed of your struggle with food\n- Felt stuck in “start over Monday” mode\n- Wondered if true freedom is even possible for you\n\nThis episode is for you.\n\nFreedom is possible. Peace is possible. And it doesn’t come from willpower — it comes from surrender. Ready to take your next step? Visit LifeUnbinged.com to connect, join a program, or find support on your journey.\n\nIf this episode encouraged you, please subscribe, leave a review, and share it with a friend who needs hope today.\n\nMake it a great day!\n\nFind me on social media:\n\nFacebook - Life Unbinged\n\nX - Life Unbinged\n\nPinterest - Life Unbinged\n\n## Page Links\n\n- https://www.buzzsprout.com/2543027\n- https://www.buzzsprout.com/2543027/episodes\n- https://www.buzzsprout.com/2543027/about\n- https://www.buzzsprout.com/2543027/follow\n- https://lifeunbinged.com/qs-weight-loss-bundle/\n- https://lifeunbinged.com/breaking-free-from-food-addiction\n- https://lifeunbinged.com/\n- https://www.instagram.com/lifeunbinged?igsh=MXcwc2p6YWs0emsydQ%3D%3D&amp;utm_source=qr\n- https://www.facebook.com/share/17hASr8Yhk/?mibextid=wwXIfr\n- https://www.tiktok.com/@lifeunbinged?_r=1&amp;_t=ZT-92IgFdcDo1m\n- https://youtube.com/@lifeunbinged7371?si=ui7uko89WErn4N0w\n- https://x.com/kristy_mccammon?s=21\n- https://www.threads.com/@lifeunbinged?igshid=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ==\n- https://pin.it/2G9clFsTg\n- https://podcasts.apple.com/podcast/id1861829733\n- https://open.spotify.com/show/0tHBNpYb5ldRMHW4ekBOsR\n- https://podcastindex.org/podcast/7623913\n- https://feeds.buzzsprout.com/2543027.rss\n","title":"My Story: Breaking Free from Sugar Addiction","httpStatus":200},"sequence_number":990}

