better with sugar?22:28 — Vacation, Disney, and defined indulgence rules24:29 — Touching the hot stove: learning from experience25:31 — Final reflections and encouragement\n\n[...]\n\n🎙️ You don’t have to be perfect to change your relationship with sugar.\n\n[...]\n\n## Quitting Sugar Without the All-or-Nothing Trap\n\n[...]\n\nEpisode #246\n\n[...]\n\n###### The Fasting Method\n\n[...]\n\nWithout the All-or-Nothing Trap - The Fasting Method\n\n[...]\n\nQuitting\n\n[...]\n\n- February 24, 2026"},"sequence_number":2873}

