d be creative about fetching the remaining pages I've already discovered. Let me fetch a few more of the promising URLs I found earlier but haven't yet retrieved full content from.\n\nLet me focus on getting more from the Life After Sugar podcast site, and also look for any BBC/Guardian transcripts."}],"summary":[]},{"type":"openrouter:web_fetch","id":"st_tmp_j9iiw2m755","status":"completed","url":"https://podcast.nettagorman.com/episode-217/","content":"\"THIS made living sugar free so much easier!\": Netta (Episode 217) - Life After Sugar Podcast\n\n# Listen to episode 217:\n\n# \"THIS made living sugar free so much easier!\": Netta\n\nMarch 9, 2025\n\nHi! It's me, Netta. And I have to tell you that all my life I was a real sweet tooth.\n\nPeople made desserts just for me, and my whole identity was wrapped up in my love for sweet foods, desserts, chocolate, ice cream, whatever.\n\nChocolate was my best friend.\n\nAnd I also had always had snacks on hand. Hidden in my drawer at work. Hidden away in my car. I used to always carry around snacks with me just in case I got hungry.\n\nSo back in 2015, when I got some life-changing advice to cut down or even cut out sugar, well... that seemed completely crazy to me!\n\nAnd I said no. No. No. No. No way.\n\nSo what changed?\n\nListen to this episode to hear how and why I ended up trying something that that I'd never tried before and that seemed crazy, and what made living sugar free so much easier.\n\nGet rid of cravings so that you can slim down and finally feel in control around food!\n\nTake the first step to get rid of cravings:\n\nDo the Cravings Quiz!\n\nGet personalized guidance from me, plus support and accountability in a small group... in the 90-day Freedom from Cravings Formulaprogram.\n\nSEE ALSO:\n\nClick here to listen\n\nClick here to listen\n\nClick here to listen\n\nClick here to listen\n\nClick here to listen\n\nClick here to listen\n\nUse the Search bar below to find an episode number, topic or guest:\n